# An egg in the party, one step short of hatching.
#
# The egg is the day care's own: the same two Bibarel egg-generate breeds, the
# same offspring personality its walk rolled, and take-egg is the call the
# day-care man's script makes when the egg is accepted, so the species, the
# inherited IVs and the moveset are all decided by the game.
#
# Then two counters. An egg loses a cycle when the day care's SHARED step
# counter reaches 255, and it hatches on the step where it has none left, so
# the recipe sets the cycles to zero and the counter to one short. take-egg
# resets that counter itself, which is why daycare-counter comes after it.

name HATCHER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 10412
money 9000
badge BADGE_ID_COAL
badge BADGE_ID_FOREST
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 25 ITEM_NONE
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 26 ITEM_NONE
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 27 ITEM_NONE
daycare 0
daycare 1
daycare-egg 0x59239384
take-egg
egg-cycles 1 0
daycare-counter 254
map MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN 0x236 0x291 FACE_DOWN
